Z||000005||mrfixit58||03-09-2000||01:39 PM||||Phil, Spyder, Rice, & whoever else is going to the Daytona show,<P>I would really like to meet you while your there. I went last year and met only one person from this forum. I won't have mine there since it's still in storage and waiting or some TLC but, that doesn't mean I can't talk shop with you guys.<P>Phil, I REALLY want to see your car. Since yours is rather distinctive, how about we all just look for you then you can help point everyone else out??<P>Hope to see ya there,<BR>Roy L.||||reg||6
Z||000006||Old Lar||03-09-2000||02:29 PM||||I'll be there with my '87 red/grey GT all the way from New York State.  I hope I have time to clean and polish since it hasn't had a bath since September.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> <BR> I should be getting it back next week in time for the next scheduled NYS blizzard   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I'll be pulling in Thursday, so I should have Friday to clean.<p>[This message has been edited by Old Lar (edited 03-09-2000).]||||reg||1
